     "\r\n  \r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" text=\"#000000\">\r\n    Dear breedRs,<br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    In the last major refactoring of breedR (v. 0.10) I introduced\r\n    inadvertedly some memory-intensive operations, that were more\r\n    evident in models with an Autoregressive spatial component.<br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    This problem was raised by Jan Kowalczyk during our last breedR\r\n    training workshop, and properly <a href=\"https://github.com/famuvie/breedR/issues/37\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/famuvie/breedR/issues/37&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244812393000&amp;usg=AOvVaw18z9YLh_lS763vCwAsa5OD\">reported</a> at\r\n    GitHub.<br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    I have just commited the <a href=\"https://github.com/famuvie/breedR/commit/c31f339bfb86b52ae0836bb4a66ecf22bf30eb19\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/famuvie/breedR/commit/c31f339bfb86b52ae0836bb4a66ecf22bf30eb19&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244812393000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2qpm1vk5ceh2NO7HQSyooL\">patch\r\n\r\n      9</a> of version 0.10 that fixes this problem.<br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    Make sure you update before running moderate AR models.<br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    ƒacu.-<br>\r\n    <div>-- <br>\r\n      \r\n      \r\n      \r\n      <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"auto\">\r\n        <tbody>\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td><a href=\"http://www.inra.fr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.inra.fr&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244812393000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1WGGqixf_7x1yUwuXZPpI_\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/breedr/attach/668e0e47d87737ba/?part=0.1.1\" alt=\"INRA\" longdesc=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/8W58qshI1EdwH97If0_p9YZdBXkZ4crVqL436HX2TKW2TUPnhw=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.inra.fr\" border=